[1m[38;5;231mWhich API shape should forms use to declare their validation rules?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mDeclarative field schema (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mRules as composable validator objects per field. Small combinator library; adding a form means writing data, not [39m
     [38;5;246mlogic.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Per-form validator function
     [38;5;246mEach form supplies its own function. Cheapest now, but 'required' and error wording get re-implemented per form.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m HTML constraint attributes
     [38;5;246mDrive from required/minlength/type in the markup via the Constraint Validation API. No JS per form, less control [39m
     [38;5;246mover messages.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
